// Title: Powershell XML Execute Command
// ID: 6c6c6282-7671-4fe9-a0ce-a2dcebdc342b
// Status: test
// Level: medium
// Author: frack113
// Date: 2022-01-19
// Tags: attack.execution, attack.t1059.001
// Description: Adversaries may abuse PowerShell commands and scripts for execution.
// PowerShell is a powerful interactive command-line interface and scripting environment included in the Windows operating system. (Citation: TechNet PowerShell)
// Adversaries can use PowerShell to perform a number of actions, including discovery of information and execution of code
// Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

(((where(ScriptBlockText ICONTAINS "IEX ") OR where(ScriptBlockText ICONTAINS "Invoke-Expression ") OR where(ScriptBlockText ICONTAINS "Invoke-Command ") OR where(ScriptBlockText ICONTAINS "ICM -"))) AND ((where(ScriptBlockText ICONTAINS "New-Object") AND where(ScriptBlockText ICONTAINS "System.Xml.XmlDocument") AND where(ScriptBlockText ICONTAINS ".Load"))))
